      "author_name": "NEERAJH | FITNESS MODEL",
      "author_id": "4560795207",
      "published_at": "2026-08-20T03:40:40.000Z",
      "text": "Self-love isn\u2019t selfish \u2014 it\u2019s knowing your worth, protecting your peace, and becoming the best version of yourself. \ud83d\udda4\ud83d\udd25#brother #love #selflove #fitness #explorar",
